 "text": "-->\nTreasurer | deuelcountysd\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nWelcome to Deuel County, South Dakota\nHOME\nDeuel County Commissioners\n2026 Commissioner Meetings\nArchived Commissioner Meeting Minutes\nList of County Offices\nAuditor\nClerk of Courts\nCommunity Health Nurse\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Management\n4-H Youth Program\nHighway Dept.\nICAP\nPlanning and Zoning\n2026 Zoning Meetings\nArchived Zoning Board Minutes\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff's Office\nState's Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Officer\nWeed Supervisor\nContact/More info\nCounty Job Opening\nCourthouse History\nTown & Township Contact Information\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nTreasurer\nThe Treasurer is the collector of taxes and has the duty to receive all money belonging to the county from whatever source (taxes, fines, etc.). The Treasurer maintains accounting records and is responsible for issuing motor vehicle registration and licenses along with reporting them to the SD Department of Motor Vehicles.\nClick Here to View Property Taxes Online\nClick Here to Pay\nProperty Taxes\nHelpful Information\n​\nVehicle Registration Renewals\nRegistration on commercial, non-commercial vehicles and trailers, motorcycles, snowmobiles, and boats are done on a staggered licensing system based on the first letter of the owner’s last name. In the case of a business, it is based on the beginning letter of the business name. You may renew your vehicle registration 90 days before your assigned month.\nRenewal months are as follows:\nA, B – January\nC, D, E – February\nF, G, J – March\nH, I, O – May\nK, L – June\nM, N – July\nP, Q, R – August\nS – September\nT thru Z – November\n​\n​\n​\n​\nLink to all things motor vehicle\n​\nhttps://my605drive.sd.gov/TAP/eServices/_/\n​\n​\nJennifer Mewherter\nTreasurer\nBrooke Pederson\nDeputy\nDeuel County Treasurer\nPO Box 680\n408 4th St. West\nClear Lake, SD 57226\nPhone (605) 874-2483\nHours\nMonday -Friday: 8:00 a.m.-5:00 p.m.\nClosed all state & federal holidays\nOffice located on the second floor of the Courthouse.\ntreasurer@deuel.sdcounty.gov\nClick here to\ngo HOME .\nCourthouse hours\n8:00 a.m. -5:00 p.m.\nClosed weekends and\nall state and federal holidays\n​\nCourthouse address\n408 4th Street West\nClear Lake, SD 57226\n© 2018 by Deuel County Proudly created with Wix.com\nPlease contact the specific office with your questions or concerns by clicking on the CONTACT US link below.\n​\nCONTACT US\nbottom of page",
